        "fa": "برچسب: جذب سیستمیک ناچیز؛ مواجهه جنین انتظار نمی‌رود.",
        "en": "Label: minimal systemic absorption; fetal exposure not expected."
      },
      "quote": "Risk Summary Ipratropium is negligibly absorbed systemically following oral inhalation; therefore, maternal use is not expected to result in fetal exposure to the drug [ see Clinical Pharmacology (12.3) ].",
